	// hash to equal the quoteHash the escrow recorded for this payment at deposit, and
	// derives the release witness commitments from it. That anchor is what lets the
	// quote supply the delivery terms, the fulfillment deadline, the source and
	// destination chains, the settler, the depositor, the source token and the source
	// amount without the caller being able to choose them. The escrow and fulfillment contracts come from
	// veri-fill's own per-chain configuration.
