	// document, so key order and whitespace are removed before hashing and a JSON round
	// trip does not change it. What DOES change it is altering a value: a renormalized
	// timestamp, or re-serializing the embedded payment_request_json, which is a string
	// field and is hashed literally. Either yields a different hash and the request is
	// refused.
